  Summary: spring-data-couchbase's reachable surface (CouchbaseTemplate, repository proxies, N1QL query derivation, mapping/converters) only exercises real code paths against a live Couchbase cluster -- there is no embedded/in-memory substitute. The sibling spring-boot-data-couchbase test in this repo avoids this by testing only autoconfiguration wiring, which isn't an option for the core module itself. A Couchbase Testcontainers setup is needed, mirroring spring-data-couchbase's own upstream integration-test infrastructure.
  
