t the current-latest minor (`6.1`) actively 302-redirects to the unversioned \"current\" page. That makes it structurally incompatible with a `$version$` template using the full `6.1.1` alias, and also conflicts with the \"no unversioned/current docs\" rule — so I used `javadoc.io` instead, which is a mechanical mirror keyed to the exact Maven coordinate+version.\n2. **Why I trust the GitHub tag format**: the docs site exposed an \"edit this page\" link for the 6.0.7 docs pointing at `github.com/spring-projects/spring-data-couchbase/blob/6.0.7/...` — direct evidence the repo tags releases with the bare version string (no `v` prefix), which is what the `test-code-url` template relies on.\n`─────────────────────────────────────────────────`\n\nSince I can't write the file myself right now, could you either apply the table above to `metadata/org.springframework.data/spring-data-couchbase/index.json` yourself, or check why `Edit`/`Write` are being denied on this path (e.g. a sandbox/permission rule scoped to this worktree) so I can make the change?\n\nEXIT_CODE: 0\n"}], "isError": false, "timestamp": 1791098747252}, {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_PE8Y7Lmn0eZzIGNSuCHuBkPA|fc_0f732eb1b10811ef016ac1ff7af23c87d1b86d880db97c69a7", "toolName": "read", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\n  \"coordinates\" : \"org.springframework.data:spring-data-couchbase:6.1.1\"\n}\n"}], "isError": false, "timestamp": 1791098747252}, {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_KBakutRPeFvifkQ3iGynrNEP|fc_0f732eb1b10811ef016ac1ff7af24887d1baaa569cfb389620", "toolName": "read", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "ENOENT: no such file or directory, access '/home/mihailo/git/graalvm-reachability-metadata/forge/local_repositories/forge_worktrees/9751-b2d960c1/build/tests/org.springframework.data:spring-data-couchbase:6.1.1/091adb46683f2f19deae0053852183c0.out'"}], "details": {}, "isError": true, "timestamp": 1791098747253}, {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_Lvp2jC89jKeDv