nUncovered call sites:\n- [reflection] java.lang.Class#getConstructor(java.lang.Class[]) <- org.springframework.data.couchbase.core.convert.CouchbasePropertyValueConverterFactory.getConverter(CouchbasePropertyValueConverterFactory.java:163) (line 163)\n- [reflection] java.lang.Class#getConstructors() <- org.springframework.data.couchbase.core.convert.CouchbasePropertyValueConverterFactory.maybeTypePropertyConverter(CouchbasePropertyValueConverterFactory.java:124) (line 124)\n\n### org.springframework.data.couchbase.core.convert.JsonValueConverter\nSource: JsonValueConverter.java\nCoverage: 0/2\nUncovered call sites:\n- [reflection] java.lang.reflect.Constructor#newInstance(java.lang.Object[]) <- org.springframework.data.couchbase.core.convert.JsonValueConverter.read(JsonValueConverter.java:47) (line 47)\n- [reflection] java.lang.reflect.Method#invoke(java.lang.Object, java.lang.Object[]) <- org.springframework.data.couchbase.core.convert.JsonValueConverter.write(JsonValueConverter.java:61) (line 61)\n\n### org.springframework.data.couchbase.repository.support.FindMethod\nSource: FindMethod.java\nCoverage: 0/2\nUncovered call sites:\n- [reflection] java.lang.Class#getDeclaredMethods() <- org.springframework.data.couchbase.repository.support.FindMethod.findDeclaredMethod(FindMethod.java:45) (line 45)\n- [reflection] java.lang.Class#getMethods() <- org.springframework.data.couchbase.repository.support.FindMethod.findMethod(FindMethod.java:33) (line 33)\n\n### org.springframework.data.couchbase.core.convert.MappingCouchbaseConverter\nSource: MappingCouchbaseConverter.java\nCoverage: 0/1\nUncovered call sites:\n- [reflection] java.lang.Class#forName(java.lang.String) <- org.springframework.data.couchbase.core.convert.MappingCouchbaseConverter.getPotentiallyConvertedSimpleRead(MappingCouchbaseConverter.java:451) (line 451)\n\n### org.springframework.data.couchbase.core.convert.OtherConverters$StringToClass\nSource: OtherConverters.java\nCoverage: 0/1\nUncovered call sites