 Compose integration, and Testcontainers connection details.\",\nmetadata/org.springframework.boot/spring-boot-amqp/index.json:39:    \"description\" : \"Spring Boot AMQP provides auto-configuration and support classes for AMQP 1.0 messaging in Spring Boot applications. It configures ProtonJ2-backed connection factories, AMQP clients, Jackson message conversion, connection properties, Docker Compose integration, and Testcontainers connection details.\",\nmetadata/org.springframework.boot/spring-boot-amqp/index.json:53:    \"description\" : \"Spring Boot AMQP provides auto-configuration and support classes for integrating Spring Boot applications with AMQP messaging. It configures RabbitMQ-related infrastructure such as connection factories, templates, listener containers, health checks, metrics, Docker Compose support, and Testcontainers integration.\",\nmetadata/org.springframework.boot/spring-boot-data-couchbase/index.json:9:      \"org.springframework.boot.data.couchbase.autoconfigure\"\nmetadata/org.springframework.boot/spring-boot-testcontainers/4.1.1/reachability-metadata.json:5:        \"typeReached\" : \"org.springframework.boot.testcontainers.service.connection.ServiceConnectionAutoConfigurationRegistrar\"\nmetadata/org.springframework.boot/spring-boot-testcontainers/4.1.1/reachability-metadata.json:11:        \"typeReached\" : \"org.springframework.boot.testcontainers.service.connection.ServiceConnectionAutoConfigurationRegistrar\"\nmetadata/org.springframework.boot/spring-boot-testcontainers/4.1.1/reachability-metadata.json:17:        \"typeReached\" : \"org.springframework.boot.testcontainers.service.connection.ServiceConnectionAutoConfigurationRegistrar\"\nmetadata/org.springframework.boot/spring-boot-testcontainers/4.1.1/reachability-metadata.json:19:      \"type\" : \"org.springframework.boot.data.redis.testcontainers.RedisContainerConnectionDetailsFactory\",\nmetadata/org.springframework.boot/spring-boot-testcontainers/4.1.1/reachability-metadata.jso